sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Browser
  participant API as Auth API
  participant DB as User database
  UI->>API: Register email and password
  API->>DB: Store bcrypt password hash
  UI->>API: Login with form credentials
  API->>DB: Verify password
  API-->>UI: Access and refresh JWTs
  UI->>API: Protected request with access JWT
  API-->>UI: Authorized response
  UI->>API: Logout
  API-->>UI: Logout acknowledgement; client clears tokens
